---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const h2c = 'mt-10 font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-navy';
const pc = 'mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft';
const ulc = 'mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-ink-soft';
const a = 'text-brass-deep underline underline-offset-2';
---

<Base title="Terms of Service | Levi Henry Group" description="The terms that govern use of thelevihenry.com and its services.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14 lg:pt-20">
      <p data-reveal class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-navy-600">Legal</p>
      <h1 data-reveal class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p data-reveal class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-faint">Last updated: 17 August 2026</p>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-line">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14 lg:py-16">
        <p class="rounded border border-line border-l-[3px] border-l-brass bg-paper p-4 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          These terms govern your use of thelevihenry.com and the services offered through it. By using the site, you agree to them. Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@thelevihenry.com" class={a}>hello@thelevihenry.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>1. Agreement to these terms</h2>
        <p class={pc}>By accessing or using <strong class="text-ink">thelevihenry.com</strong> (the "Site") or engaging our services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site or our services.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>2. About our services</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Levi Henry Group provides consulting, education, and technology services, including sales development coaching, training and courses, marketing and paid acquisition support, and the build of websites, funnels, and revenue infrastructure. The specific scope, deliverables, timelines, and fees of any engagement are agreed separately in a proposal, order, or written agreement, which takes precedence over general statements on the Site.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>3. Use of the Site</h2>
        <p class={pc}>You agree to use the Site lawfully and not to:</p>
        <ul class={ulc}>
          <li>misuse, disrupt, or attempt to gain unauthorised access to the Site or its systems;</li>
          <li>copy, resell, or exploit Site content except as permitted below;</li>
          <li>use the Site to infringe others' rights or break the law.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class={h2c}>4. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class={pc}>The Site and its content (text, design, graphics, logo, and materials) are owned by or licensed to Levi Henry Group and are protected by intellectual-property laws. You may view and share the content for personal, non-commercial reference. Course and program materials are licensed to you for your own use and may not be redistributed or resold without our written permission.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>5. Purchases, pre-orders &amp; payments</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Some offerings, such as courses (including pre-orders), coaching, and services, are paid. Prices, payment terms, delivery, and any refund or cancellation terms are set out at the point of sale or in your agreement with us. Pre-orders reserve access to a product ahead of its launch; expected timelines are estimates and may change. Payments may be processed by third-party providers subject to their own terms.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>6. No guarantee of results or income</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Our education and consulting help you build skills and systems, but <strong class="text-ink">we do not guarantee any specific result, income, revenue, or outcome</strong>. Any figures, examples, case studies, or testimonials describe particular situations and are not promises or typical results. Your results depend on many factors we do not control, including your effort, experience, market conditions, and how you apply what you learn. Nothing on the Site is financial, legal, tax, or investment advice.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>7. Third-party links and services</h2>
        <p class={pc}>The Site links to third-party websites and relies on third-party services (such as hosting, DNS, email, payment, and course platforms). We are not responsible for the content, policies, or availability of third parties.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>8. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class={pc}>The Site and its content are provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied, including fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted, secure, or error-free.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class={pc}>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Levi Henry Group and Levi Henry will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any loss of profits, revenue, data, or goodwill, arising from your use of the Site or services. Where liability cannot be excluded, it is limited to the amount you paid us for the relevant service.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>10. Indemnification</h2>
        <p class={pc}>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Levi Henry Group from claims arising out of your misuse of the Site or violation of these terms.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>11. Governing law</h2>
        <p class={pc}>These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria, without regard to conflict-of-law rules. Any disputes will be handled in the courts located in Nigeria, unless otherwise required by applicable law.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>12. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p class={pc}>We may update these terms from time to time. The "last updated" date above shows the latest version, and continued use of the Site means you accept the changes.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>13. Contact</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:hello@thelevihenry.com" class={a}>hello@thelevihenry.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
